<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideogra=
ph'>This
apps main task is to allow you to visualise temperature and humidity data t=
hat
has been recorded into a comma separated value (csv) file. </p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideogra=
ph'><span
lang=3DEN-US style=3D'mso-ansi-language:EN-US'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<h2 style=3D'text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;page-break-aft=
er:
avoid'><b><span lang=3DEN-US style=3D'font-size:14.0pt;mso-ansi-language:EN=
-US'>How
it works.<o:p></o:p></span></b></h2>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideogra=
ph'><span
lang=3DEN-US style=3D'mso-ansi-language:EN-US'><span
style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>=A0</span></span></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideogra=
ph'>Open
the app and you will have the following GUI.</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideogra=
ph'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal align=3Dcenter style=3D'text-align:center'><span
style=3D'mso-no-proof:yes'><!--[if gte vml 1]><v:shape id=3D"Picture_x0020_=
2"
 o:spid=3D"_x0000_i1027" type=3D"#_x0000_t75" style=3D'width:286pt;height:1=
42pt;
 visibility:visible;mso-wrap-style:square'>
 <v:imagedata src=3D"Help_files/image003.png" o:title=3D""/>
</v:shape><![endif]--><![if !vml]><img width=3D381 height=3D189
src=3D"Help_files/image004.jpg" v:shapes=3D"Picture_x0020_2"><![endif]></sp=
an></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal align=3Dcenter style=3D'text-align:center'><o:p>&nbsp;=
</o:p></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideogra=
ph'><u>CSV
Data<o:p></o:p></u></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideogra=
ph'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideogra=
ph'>The folder
structure where the data is stored and how it is named is important. The app
starts to look under the folder Data into subfolders for the year, then und=
er the
year into subfolders for the months (Sentence case for months). Under the
months are the csv files for that month. This is illustrated below:</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideogra=
ph'><span
style=3D'mso-no-proof:yes'><!--[if gte vml 1]><v:shape id=3D"Picture_x0020_=
3"
 o:spid=3D"_x0000_i1026" type=3D"#_x0000_t75" style=3D'width:127.5pt;height=
:159.5pt;
 visibility:visible;mso-wrap-style:square'>
 <v:imagedata src=3D"Help_files/image005.png" o:title=3D""/>
</v:shape><![endif]--><![if !vml]><img width=3D170 height=3D213
src=3D"Help_files/image006.jpg" v:shapes=3D"Picture_x0020_3"><![endif]></sp=
an></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideogra=
ph'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideogra=
